<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Blue Q1 net up 37 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Blue Q1 net up 37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the first three months of the financial year to March 31, 1997, of Blue Diamonds Jewellery Worldwide Ltd.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			  Q1 1996/1997	 Q1 1995/1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     160.49     vs	148.80</p>
<p>    Net profit	    55.13     vs	 40.27</p>
<p>    Tax			---		    ---</p>
<p>NOTE - Profits are exempt from tax under the terms which Blue Diamonds was set up. Its main line of activity is exporting locally made diamond and gem-studded jewellery.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom 941-434319</p>
</text>
